	quest.008E4D4C91B09276.quest_desc: [
		"&dStaff of Traveling&r is a teleportation tool that allows instant movement between &bTravel Anchors&r and &bEnhanced Obelisks&r.  "
		""
		"Powered by &aForge Energy&r, it also enables short-distance teleportation by right-clicking in the air while sneaking."
	]
	quest.00AE3C5F20364BEA.quest_desc: [
		"This one is the first step towards some &eadvanced resource gathering tools&r."
		""
		"You may need to unlock &abetter machinery&r to find where should you be pointing this laser."
	]
	quest.00AE3C5F20364BEA.quest_subtitle: "LAZORS!!"
	quest.00AE3C5F20364BEA.title: "Drilling"
	quest.00B243B328CD85B4.quest_desc: [
		"The foundry specializes in creating&e all the alloys&r needed to make &eOritech machines&r."
		""
		"Some of these alloys can be &bcrafted by hand&r, doing so consumes &csignificantly more resources&r."
	]
	quest.00B243B328CD85B4.quest_subtitle: "Multiblock - requires &e3&r &dMachine Cores&r!"
	quest.0131D974B31D8BE1.quest_desc: [
		"Combining a &bpickaxe&r, an &baxe&r and a &bshovel&r, you can create &epaxels&r which can serve as any of those three!"
		""
		"Ideal to save up some space in your inventory."
	]
	quest.0131D974B31D8BE1.quest_subtitle: "All in one tool!"
	quest.0131D974B31D8BE1.title: "Paxels!"
	quest.0162ABDB0F0915AA.quest_desc: ["The Regulator Upgrade controls how many items are moved, ensuring precise amounts are transferred."]
	quest.01A3B8E7EA1F98F7.quest_desc: [
		"&dWildfire&r, the master of blazes, which is protected by four shields."
		""
		"This encounter is not a friendly one, watch out for its &bshield debris barrage&r and ground-shaking &bshockwave attack&r."
		""
		"When cornered, it summons blazes for reinforcement."
		""
		"Conquer the challenge, wield strategy against this fiery sentinel in it's &bcitadel&r domain."
	]
	quest.01A3B8E7EA1F98F7.title: "The Wildfire"
	quest.01D26F352CEDCB66.quest_desc: [
		"If you already found some &bmagic books&r, you will see that their cooldowns are a bit high..."
		""
		"By equipping pieces of the &eMage set&r, you can &afire spells faster&r and also &aabsorb damage&r from spells that come your way!"
		""
		"As for the &emage staff&r, it doesn't do anything. At least not for you..."
	]
	quest.01D26F352CEDCB66.quest_subtitle: "And now for the next trick, i summon a quest"
	quest.01D26F352CEDCB66.title: "Mage gear!"
	quest.02F18B1E21E4D4B6.title: "Redstone I"
	quest.035F072880BDBC09.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.0393A48E09BEB21F.quest_subtitle: "Leons favorite"
	quest.03E4D1DC981ABFF4.title: "Wither"
	quest.04BF96BD7F9B842C.quest_desc: [
		"This setup of machines will allow you to &amultiply&r the yield of raw ore materials."
		""
		"- First you will supply your &aWashing Factory&r with a &braw ore&r and&b liquid meat&r, to produce &eraw ore meat&r."
		""
		"- This must be sent into a &aFermentation station&r in order to be &efermented&r. This will take some time, but that can be cut with the use of &aaddons&r."
		""
		"- Once your &bfermented ore&r is ready, you can mix it with &bsand&r in a &aFluid Sieving Machine&r to produce &eore dust&r, which can be smelted the same way as raw ore."
	]
	quest.04BF96BD7F9B842C.quest_subtitle: "Multiplying ores? It's a miracle!"
	quest.04BF96BD7F9B842C.title: "Optimizing ore production"
	quest.04D05F87CF9D52A0.quest_desc: [
		"- Press \"&bP&r\" to toggle the advanced movement"
		""
		"- Hold \"&bCTRL&r\" while sprinting for fast run"
		""
		"- Press \"&bC&r\" for crawling and for sliding, when fast running"
		""
		"- Press \"&bR&r\" while fast running for a role"
		""
		""
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&eAdditional shortcuts in Air&r"
		""
		" - Hold \"&bW/S&r\" + \"&bR&r\" before landing, to &ddecrease Fall Damage&r"
		""
		" - Landing on Leaves, Lilypads and similar blocks grants &dno Fall Damage&r"
		""
		" - Press \"&bSHIFT&r\" to increase your fall Speed"
		""
		" - Repeat to increase it further"
	]
	quest.04D05F87CF9D52A0.quest_subtitle: "&eMovement shortcuts&r"
	quest.04D05F87CF9D52A0.title: "First of all: Movement"
	quest.06266D1B0E7FC418.quest_desc: [
		"By cooking &bRotten Flesh&r in the &bSoul Furnace&r you can obtain &eCrystalized Blood&r, which is a material for some interesting gear and also to summon two different companions!"
		""
		"However, to bring those companions out, you will need a &eShadow Bell&r."
	]
	quest.06266D1B0E7FC418.quest_subtitle: "This is some scary stuff huh."
	quest.06266D1B0E7FC418.title: "Dark Arts"
	quest.063E980ED2A2A29B.quest_desc: ["The ideal position of the &bbookshelves&r is a square of 15 placed in a 5x5-block outline, with the &benchantment table&r in the middle."]
	quest.063E980ED2A2A29B.quest_subtitle: "&d15 bookshelves will max out your enchanting table.&r"
	quest.06431DFB84FE0F99.quest_desc: [
		"&dTowers&r can contain cool &eGliders&r and feature a &eWaystone&r!"
		""
		"Gliders come in different tiers and can be crafted/repaired using &bReinforced Paper&r."
	]
	quest.06431DFB84FE0F99.title: "Find a Tower"
	quest.06D898E566291351.quest_desc: [
		"Autocrafters store your &dcrafting patterns&r, then automatically execute those recipes on demand."
		""
		"Supply the &bmaterials&r, and let the system handle everything from basic tasks to complex &emulti-step creations&r."
	]
	quest.06E3B3A8534B2796.quest_desc: [
		"You can summon this companion by interacting with a &bRespawn Totem&r using an &bOld Cloak&r instead of an Hourglass."
		""
		"This scary fellow can cast &astars&r that chase enemies and explode on impact, and at the same time can turn itself and its owner &ainvisible&r for a short period of time!"
	]
	quest.06E3B3A8534B2796.quest_subtitle: "Invisible comp- wait where did it go."
	quest.06E3B3A8534B2796.title: "The Cloak"
	quest.0793E50DD8637A88.quest_desc: ["&dPhotovoltaic Plates&r are crafted from &bPhotovoltaic Composite&r and serve as a key component in building &ePhotovoltaic Modules&r."]
	quest.07C4CE3E87D2766A.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMob Crusher&r is similar to the Mob Slaughter Factory, with the difference of it giving the &emob's drops&r as output."
		""
		"It will also award you with &eEssence&r, which is the equivalent of &aexperience&r. This can be used later for &eenchantments&r, or sent to a &aDissolution Chamber&r to deliver as &eBottles of Enchanting&r.  "
		""
		"You can also adjust your Mob Crusher for it not to give essence, which will result in a better yield of drops."
	]
	quest.07C4CE3E87D2766A.quest_subtitle: "Want to see a magic trick?"
	quest.07C4CE3E87D2766A.title: "Advanced Mob Farming"
	quest.097EC43A81762188.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.097EC43A81762188.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.0989047F760D4202.quest_desc: [
		"A common mistake is using the &cwrong Soul Vial&r when binding a &eBroken Spawner&r."
		""
		"This quest will allow you to &nretrieve the items&r used to create the spawner so that you can try again."
	]
	quest.0989047F760D4202.quest_subtitle: "Second chance"
	quest.0989047F760D4202.title: "It was the wrong one!"
	quest.09941534FE1BFF82.quest_desc: [
		"The &dHunter's Handgun&r is a ranged weapon that uses &bBullets&r as ammo and deals high damage.  "
		""
		"It’s especially effective in mid-range combat and can be loaded with different bullet types for varied effects."
	]
	quest.09941534FE1BFF82.quest_subtitle: "Don't ask, the gun is cool"
	quest.09941534FE1BFF82.title: "Open fire!"
	quest.09A87C4F4795348D.title: "Nether Mats"
	quest.0AED8186C0CF9D07.quest_desc: ["The &dLantern of Paranoia&r auto-places &btorches&r from your inventory in dark areas, preventing mob spawns as you explore."]
	quest.0BA9D52E421F0820.quest_desc: [
		"It was this last branch of Builders who uncovered something even greater."
		""
		"Deep beneath the earth, hidden beyond the reach of sunlight, we found a structure that did not belong to us."
		""
		"A massive frame, ancient and silent, stood at the heart of the cavern.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"A portal, but not like the one to the Nether."
		""
		"It was made of unknown material, radiating energy beyond our understanding.  "
		""
		"We built a city around it, an underground stronghold where we studied its mysteries.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"As we examined the caves, we discovered something else."
		""
		"A strange, living substance that grew across the stone, pulsing softly in the dark.  "
		"&6It absorbed sound, devouring even the faintest whispers.&r  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6We called it Sculk.&r"
		""
		"At first, we believed it to be harmless. A mere anomaly connected to the portal frame.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&cBut the more we experimented, the more we realized that it was spreading. And it was listening.&r  "
	]
	quest.0BA9D52E421F0820.title: "City of Darkness"
	quest.0BEEC906FEC7B7E8.quest_desc: ["The End dimension contains uraninite ore geodes, making it an excellent place to gather uraninite."]
	quest.0C37B004CC1E0132.quest_desc: [
		"Covering the &bHomunculus&r with&b bread&r and cooking it in the &bSoul Furnace&r will give you a &eCroissant Egg&r!"
		""
		"Once that's ready, place the egg in the world to begin the hatching process of your very first companion!"
	]
	quest.0C37B004CC1E0132.quest_subtitle: "Now with a surprise inside."
	quest.0C37B004CC1E0132.title: "Bread!"
	quest.0D2822E29FBEBB40.quest_desc: [
		"Deep in the Jungle, you will be able to find an &bancient structure&r where a &bbig monkey&r is praying."
		""
		"Be &cvery careful&r, you may not want to disturb it unless you are &afully prepared&r to face its anger!"
	]
	quest.0D2822E29FBEBB40.quest_subtitle: "Time for a boss battle!"
	quest.0D2822E29FBEBB40.title: "The Pontiff"
	quest.0D992FC34B91C8E4.quest_desc: ["The &ePhoenix Down&r &drevives you once&r upon death, restoring some health."]
	quest.0E66A22B64E0EAC7.quest_desc: ["Machines require Forge Energy (FE) in order to work. You may find better alternatives with different mods in this modpack, but for now a basic Generator like this one will do."]
	quest.0E66A22B64E0EAC7.quest_subtitle: "Why is this not moving?"
	quest.0E66A22B64E0EAC7.title: "Energy!"
	quest.0F1C22C1700FA328.quest_subtitle: "Submit items"
	quest.0F1C22C1700FA328.title: "Ancient Trade"
	quest.0F20A837DE9B5559.quest_desc: ["The Speed Upgrade accelerates item transfers and processing."]
	quest.0F66A0372700451F.quest_desc: ["The &eInfernal Chalice&r stores &blava&r when right-clicked and grants &dfire resistance&r while in your inventory or worn."]
	quest.0FBC8BA8D31F14EC.quest_desc: ["The Stack Upgrade lets you move multiple items in a single operation."]
	quest.0FFF66188456E4AA.quest_desc: ["&dDuratium&r is a high-tier alloy used to create particle accelerators and reactors."]
	quest.0FFF66188456E4AA.quest_subtitle: "A very dense Material"
	quest.10350609F4F36736.quest_desc: [
		"In order to use the handgun, you will need &eMagazines&r and &bBullets&r(Shots)."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Their recipes are easy to follow, and bullets can be &aimbued&r with potion effects, making them useful in a variety of situations."
	]
	quest.10350609F4F36736.quest_subtitle: "You need something to fire the gun"
	quest.10350609F4F36736.title: "Ammunition"
	quest.103AA33AE9A749BD.quest_desc: [
		"&eFlux Networks&r lets you create and manage &bWireless Energy Networks&r, eliminating the need for cables."
		""
		"A &dMaterial Stonework Factory&r for Obsidian production can be helpful."
	]
	quest.103AA33AE9A749BD.quest_subtitle: "Smelt &bObsidian&r to &eFlux Dust&r."
	quest.103AA33AE9A749BD.title: "Flux, Flux, Flux!"
	quest.10D1AD089608C1D3.quest_desc: [
		"&dDivine Armor&r is a striking golden-red set with customizable cloth and exceptional protection."
		""
		"A full set blocks an attack every minute."
	]
	quest.10D1AD089608C1D3.title: "&dDivine"
	quest.11172AC72364C1B2.quest_desc: [
		"The &dPhotovoltaic Composite&r is a key material for crafting solar-based energy solutions."
		""
		"It is used to create &ePhotovoltaic Plates&r for modules which generate &aForge Energy&r (FE) from sunlight."
	]
	quest.11172AC72364C1B2.title: "First Composite"
	quest.113BEE3FA65998D7.quest_desc: [
		"The &dDisk Drive&r is the main component for storing data in Refined Storage."
		""
		"Insert &bstorage disks&r into it to hold a wide variety of items or fluids."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"It connects directly to your network, allowing quick access and efficient management of your resources."
	]
	quest.117744B0C8C17708.quest_subtitle: "Requires Smithing Table"
	quest.117744B0C8C17708.title: "Netherite"
	quest.1187A3E8812668B0.quest_subtitle: "Tokkis favorite"
	quest.11984D191D849334.quest_desc: [
		"The &eCoin of Fortune&r pulls &ditems and experience&r orbs toward you when kept in your inventory or worn in a curio slot."
		""
		"It helps with quick collection during combat, mining, or mob farming."
	]
	quest.11DFE77814AA18C6.quest_desc: [
		"To use them place two or more elevators in the &bsame X and Z coordinates&r."
		""
		"To move between them simply &ejump&r to go to the elevator above,"
		""
		"or &esneak&r to go to the one below."
	]
	quest.12536C2280D7B11A.quest_desc: [
		"&bNickel&r is crucial for several &emachine&r and &ealloy recipes&r."
		""
		"Also mine redstone, gold, and some diamonds, and watch for amethyst geodes for budding amethyst needed later for &dfluxite production&r."
	]
	quest.12536C2280D7B11A.quest_subtitle: "Work in progress"
	quest.12536C2280D7B11A.title: "Getting started"
	quest.127389370E15F299.title: "Diamond"
	quest.1357DE16AB051E9C.quest_desc: [
		"&bMachine cores&r determine the quality of &eOritech multiblock machines&r."
		""
		"Their main purpose is to increase how many &elayers of extenders&r and &econnected addons&r a machine can support."
	]
	quest.1357DE16AB051E9C.quest_subtitle: "Required for Multiblock machines"
	quest.1357DE16AB051E9C.title: "Cores for Multiblocks"
	quest.13D6F25F17991FE5.quest_subtitle: "More layers, more efficiency"
	quest.13EA585E77D37004.quest_desc: ["&aAddons&r can be used to improve some machines, making them work &efaster&r and &ebetter&r. They can also increase the effective &erange&r of detection for other machines."]
	quest.13EA585E77D37004.quest_subtitle: "Let's make this move faster!"
	quest.13EA585E77D37004.title: "Upgrades"
	quest.1418C5E4346D5527.quest_desc: [
		"Create &dConduits&r to transfer items, liquids, and energy between machines for better automation control."
		""
		"A key advantage of &dEnderIO&r's Conduits is their ability to overlap in the same block, saving space and improving organization."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Gather &bClay, Gravel, and Sand&r to craft &eComposite&r, then smelt it into &eBinder&r to start making Conduits!"
	]
	quest.1418C5E4346D5527.quest_subtitle: "Sticky situation"
	quest.1418C5E4346D5527.title: "Conduits!"
	quest.144F75EA01366D8E.quest_desc: [
		"The &dPrometheum Pickaxe&r is an unbreakable high-tier mining tool."
		"It has very high mining speed and can switch between area mining and &dsilk touch&r harvesting."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"It can be enchanted with standard pickaxe enchantments like Efficiency and Fortune."
		""
		"Note that Silk Touch is provided natively by its secondary mode."
	]
	quest.1506EA722C4D3607.quest_desc: ["The &dMachine Casing&r is a crucial crafting ingredient for many Refined Storage components."]
	quest.15769283034E40E3.quest_desc: [
		"&eInventory Shortcuts&r"
		""
		" - Press \"&bMiddle Mouse/Wheel&r\" to sort your Inventory"
		""
		"Hover over an Item and:"
		""
		" - Press \"&bR&r\" to see how it's crafted"
		""
		" - Press \"&bU&r\" to see what it's used for"
		""
		" - Search for an Item and it's Recipe in the Bottom Right Corner"
		""
		" - &bDouble-clicking&r that Search Bar will highlight that item in your Inventories"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&eInstant Multiplayer and Teams&r"
		""
		" - &bOpen to LAN&r generates an IP adress in Chat, allowing players to join your world &dwithout setting up a server or port forwarding!&r"
		""
		" - Open your Inventory and open the FTB Teams menu in the Top Left Corner"
		""
		" - Create a Party and progress together"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&eShaders&r"
		""
		" - Press \"&bK&r\" to activate the shader preset"
		""
		" - Press \"&bL&r\" to open the shaderpacks menu"
	]
	quest.15769283034E40E3.quest_subtitle: "&eCoop, inventory and shader Shortcuts&r"
	quest.1641B4C4CBCCF180.quest_desc: [
		"&eLiquid meat&r is the main product of your &bMob Slaughter Factory&r."
		""
		"This fluid has some interesting uses, and can also be consumed as food with a &acertain tool&r."
		""
		"Pick some liquid meat with a &bbucket&r to complete this quest."
	]
	quest.1641B4C4CBCCF180.quest_subtitle: "Food? Maybe."
	quest.1641B4C4CBCCF180.title: "Liquid Meat"
	quest.1682A0B3F5578AAF.quest_desc: [
		"&dPedestal&r (&oDisplay Only&r) is a decorative block used to display &erare items&r or &bspecial drops&r."
		""
		"Place any item on it to show it off. It has no extra function but looks great in your base or trophy room."
	]
	quest.1682A0B3F5578AAF.quest_subtitle: "Show off your items with style."
	quest.1682A0B3F5578AAF.title: "Pedestals!"
	quest.168FFD60441A6DFC.title: "Corals"
	quest.1780DB5F81D7683E.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1780DB5F81D7683E.title: "Bookworm"
	quest.17BE85E4390E3ADF.quest_desc: [
		"&dReinforced Obsidian&r is an extremely hard block, making it one of the strongest defensive materials."
		""
		"Craft it using &bObsidian&r and &bDark Steel&r to create a secure &eWither-proof structure&r, perfect for mob farms or containment chambers."
	]
	quest.17BE85E4390E3ADF.quest_subtitle: "Wither proof!"
	quest.17DEAD0F68C6246B.quest_desc: [
		"Lurking in the Nether, you can find these small demons called &eImps&r..."
		""
		"You can attempt to tame it by giving it a &bcoin&r, but if you fail, it will turn &caggressive&r and start attacking you!"
		""
		"However, if you succeed in taming it, the Imp will be transformed into a &eMinion&r. These creatures &achange their shape&r depending on the dimension they are in, and each form has different abilities!"
		""
		"If you feel lucky, you can give each form its respective &bcoin&r again to gamble and obtain a &emagic book&r. Or instead give it a &bnetherite chain&r to &elock its current form&r no matter where they are."
	]
	quest.17DEAD0F68C6246B.quest_subtitle: "Shape-shifting companion!"
	quest.17DEAD0F68C6246B.title: "Minions"
	quest.17E7F0F0AD1D469A.quest_desc: [
		"The &dMachine Addon Extender&r is used to increase the number of available &eaddon slots&r for a machine."
		""
		"By itself, it does not provide any bonuses, but it lets you place &nmore&r addons than the &bmachine's base quality&r would normally allow."
	]
	quest.180C3636818E53B9.quest_desc: ["The &eAngelic Feather&r prevents &dfall damage&r and grants a small &djump boost&r while in your inventory or worn in a curio slot."]
	quest.1860748C142654C8.quest_desc: [
		"&dEnderIO&r is a technology-focused mod that enhances &apower generation&r, &6automation&r, and &bresource processing&r. "
		""
		"It provides compact and flexible solutions for managing items, fluids, energy, and redstone."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Key elements include &eAlloy Smelters&r and &eSAG Mills&r for material processing, &dConduits&r for efficient transport, and &eCapacitors&r to boost machines."
		""
		"It also features &dteleportation and dimensional travel&r for advanced mobility."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Master these systems to build a fully automated and efficient tech network!"
	]
	quest.1860748C142654C8.quest_subtitle: "Tech, Transportation and Automation"
	quest.1860748C142654C8.title: "&bEnderIO"
	quest.18EC56703A424463.quest_desc: [
		"The &ePowered Furnace&r is a modern replacement for the traditional stone furnace."
		""
		"It uses &bRF energy&r to smelt items at a much higher speed and efficiency."
	]
	quest.18EC56703A424463.quest_subtitle: "Multiblock - requires &e1&r &dMachine Core&r!"
	quest.192DFFEC831DF27D.quest_subtitle: "Required for Multiblock machines"
	quest.196023BD7BB276EB.quest_desc: ["The Ender Dragon drops a Dragon Heart, crucial for Draconic Evolution crafting."]
	quest.196023BD7BB276EB.title: "Dragon Slayer"
	quest.1A4C716D4E3407AF.title: "Allrounder"
	quest.1B6AD745BD5B843B.quest_desc: [
		"Infinity tools can be upgraded by charging them up with &benergy&r, and will use this energy up whenever you do stuff with them. There's a way to prevent them from using energy, but that's on you to find out!"
		""
		"This station will &estore energy&r and give it to any infinity tool placed on it. Be careful though, as this machine will absorb energy very quickly!"
	]
	quest.1B6AD745BD5B843B.quest_subtitle: "Where's my energy? Oh."
	quest.1B6AD745BD5B843B.title: "Charging up"
	quest.1C5E2BBFFF8287B1.quest_desc: [
		"The Grid is your main interface for &eaccessing&r and &emanaging items and fluids&r."
		""
		"It shows all stored items and fluids, lets you add or remove them, and provides search and sorting options for quick organization"
	]
	quest.1C6A4223182E1362.quest_desc: [
		"One night, the silence of the underground city was shattered.  "
		"A deep tremor shook the ground, and an overwhelming presence filled the air.  "
		""
		"&6From the depths of the spreading Sculk, something emerged.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"It had no eyes, yet it perceived everything. It had no voice, yet its presence swallowed all sound. It moved through vibrations, hunting with unnatural precision."
		""
		"&cIt stood as the guardian of the portal frame, and so we called it the Warden. &r "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The first attack was swift and brutal."
		""
		"&6Entire sections of the city were lost within minutes.&r"
		""
		"&cThe Warden struck down any who tried to escape, and our strongest warriors fell before it.&r"
		""
		"But we were the last real Builders. We would not be destroyed by our own discovery again."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"With our knowledge of Redstone Flux and machinery, we built traps, forged weapons, and fought back."
		""
		"At last, the Warden fell after seven relentless hours of battle that felt like months.From its remains, we extracted a core of pulsing energy, unlike any material we had ever encountered"
		""
		"&6The Heart of the Warden. With this, the portal could finally be activated.&r"
	]
	quest.1C6A4223182E1362.title: "Seven Hour War"
	quest.1C7C37DB4CA82054.quest_desc: [
		"The &dEmperor's Chalice&r is a reusable item that places &ewater&r when used and can remove &bliquids&r when sneaking."
		""
		"It never runs out."
	]
	quest.1D7EDA760D901F5E.quest_desc: [
		"If you travel through the swamp, you may find this &efunny frog casino dealer&r jumping around..."
		""
		"Bring a &bbee&r close to it and &bkill it&r in order to tame Cornelius as your pet!"
		""
		"Cornelius cannot attack on its own, but can &asummon entities&r to do the dirty work for him! You may need to pay him some &bcoins&r for him to cooperate though.."
	]
	quest.1D7EDA760D901F5E.quest_subtitle: "Summoner companion!"
	quest.1D7EDA760D901F5E.title: "Cornelius"
	quest.1DA0B271D5353C4A.quest_desc: [
		"Once you are clear, interacting with the Magic Glove will trigger a &arock, paper and scissors game&r!"
		""
		"In order to play the game, you will need (literally) &brock&r (cobblestone will do),&b paper&r and &bscissors&r (in this case, shears)."
		""
		"If you manage to win some matches against it, you will &etame&r it and make it follow you! All that will be left then is to give it an &bEmpty Puppet&r so that the glove can control it like a marionette."
		""
		"The Puppet itself doesn't do much until you equip it with &barms&r! These are craftable and exchangeable, so have fun with it!"
	]
	quest.1DA0B271D5353C4A.quest_subtitle: "All-around companion!"
	quest.1DA0B271D5353C4A.title: "The Puppet!"
	quest.1DEA734F0798C10E.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you can build basic machines, let's begin by using a &aFluid Extractor&r to retrieve &elatex&r from trees. Just place any &blog&r in front of the machine and it will start consuming it to get the fluid out."
		""
		"The extraction will be a lot faster if you can supply energy to the machine."
	]
	quest.1DEA734F0798C10E.quest_subtitle: "Bet you didn't know this comes from trees, huh?"
	quest.1DEA734F0798C10E.title: "Latex"
	quest.1E25B0D745119206.quest_desc: [
		"Water bottles from vanilla will not work with Reliquary's potions, so you must craft &eCondensed Vials&r from &bGlass Panes&r to use them."
		""
		"Add &bGunpowder&r to make them &eSplash Potions&r, or &bDragon's Breath&r to turn them into &eLingering Potions&r."
	]
	quest.1E25B0D745119206.quest_subtitle: "Bottles were too big"
	quest.1E25B0D745119206.title: "Condensed Vials"
	quest.1E9F823817DF6E02.quest_desc: [
		"The &eMagicbane&r is a golden sword that boosts &dReliquary mob drops&r and gains damage from enchantments applied to it."
		""
		"Due to its low durability, pairing it with a &dTouchstone of Midas&r is highly recommended."
	]
	quest.1E9F823817DF6E02.quest_subtitle: "It's wizard time, i cast sword."
	quest.1F0CA88F97F73CD2.quest_desc: [
		"You can obtain &bCharm Fragments&r by dropping or crafting them from hostile monsters. Combine them to create &eMonster Charms&r."
		""
		"While carrying a charm, monsters of that type &dwill not attack you&r. Attacking them will reduce the charm’s durability. Use it for safer exploration or farming."
	]
	quest.1F0CA88F97F73CD2.quest_subtitle: "I'm your friend, I swear!"
	quest.1F0CA88F97F73CD2.title: "Charms"
	quest.1F621985B802C2D4.quest_subtitle: "Special shoes that let you traverse vertical surfaces with ease."
	quest.200759A5E3973C07.quest_desc: [
		"The Builders stepped through the portal, entering a world of pure darkness."
		""
		"&6There were no cities, no signs of life. Only an endless landscape covered in Sculk, stretching beyond the horizon.&r  "
		""
		"Determined to study this place, we built a temple,  "
		"a fortress from which we could unlock the secrets of this new dimension.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"In our excavation, we uncovered a new material buried beneath the sculk-infested land.  "
		"&6A purple ore, stronger than any metal we had encountered.&r  "
		""
		"We named it Draconium in memory of the first great threat we faced beyond our world.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"With Draconium, we created weapons and machines beyond anything seen before.  "
		"&6Could this be the key to conquering the previously uncharted depths of the End?&r  "
	]
	quest.200759A5E3973C07.title: "The Otherside"
	quest.20CC5B11C8E11426.quest_desc: ["The &dAtomic Forge&r is a machine used to create &eadvanced computer chips&r, &ereinforce deepslate&r, and help with high-yield ore processing."]
	quest.217AE3750AA92056.quest_desc: [
		"&dVillages&r are home to helpful &eVillagers&r that offer trades and useful resources."
		""
		"Exploring the world and finding one can greatly boost your early survival.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Look for them in &bplains, deserts, savannas, taigas,&r and other common biomes. They often contain &bhay bales, crops,&r and even &echests with loot&r worth collecting."
	]
	quest.21CDD6AE08F84BA2.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.21CDD6AE08F84BA2.quest_subtitle: "Tier between Diamond and Netherite."
	quest.21CDD6AE08F84BA2.title: "&dResonarium&r"
	quest.223E33CD74F5DA6D.quest_desc: [
		"All machinery from Industrial Foregoing will require you to create frames in order to craft them."
		""
		"This one is the first of four different tiers of &amachine frames&r, which you will use for basic contraptions. Make sure to get plenty of them!"
	]
	quest.223E33CD74F5DA6D.quest_subtitle: "Ohh... machines... this looks interesting."
	quest.223E33CD74F5DA6D.title: "&aGetting started&r"
	quest.229DE47D4762B1BD.title: "Advanced Processor"
	quest.22D85AF1CFB83439.quest_desc: [
		"Customizable backpacks that can be &2placed&r, &dcolored&r, &eupgraded&r for more space, and enhanced with functional features."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Press \"&bB&r\" to open your Backpack on the fly."
		""
		"Press \"&bMiddle Mouse/Wheel&r\" for Inventory sorting."
	]
	quest.22D85AF1CFB83439.quest_subtitle: "Craft your first Backpack!"
	quest.22D85AF1CFB83439.title: "First Backpack"
	quest.2310E5B605D51D1B.quest_desc: ["The &aDissolution Chamber&r is a very important machine in this mod, which uses combinations of &bitems, fluids and energy&r to create stuff."]
	quest.2310E5B605D51D1B.quest_subtitle: "Not your usual way of crafting."
	quest.23287B4EDC955230.quest_desc: [
		"Reliquary adds powerful &dcombat tools&r to enhance your offense and defense.  "
		""
		"Explore these items to gain an edge and improve your &echances of survival&r."
	]
	quest.25AD4E830E2AF3FC.quest_desc: [
		"To summon this cursed blade, you will need to craft a &bShade Sword Altar&r, then feed it &bCrystallized Blood&r and link a &bShadow Bell&r to it."
		""
		"Once that's done, just use the bell to summon a &eShade Sword&r!"
		""
		"This creature's main purpose (as you would probably figure) is to &adeal tons of damage&r! It flies around you until you attack something. Then it will change it's target to said creature and attack it non-stop!"
		""
		"Same as the Shade Maw, this one is &btemporary&r."
	]
	quest.25AD4E830E2AF3FC.quest_subtitle: "Attack companion!"
	quest.25AD4E830E2AF3FC.title: "The Shade Sword"
	quest.25BFF4AB99376383.quest_desc: ["&dItem Conduits&r transfer &bitems&r between &binventories&r with precise filtering and speed control.  "]
	quest.25BFF4AB99376383.title: "Item Conduits"
	quest.26003A59449EAE28.quest_desc: ["A standard &belectric motor&r used to drive mechanical parts in &eindustrial machines&r."]
	quest.26003A59449EAE28.quest_subtitle: "Crafting Ingredients"
	quest.262B4DF170A4A4AA.quest_desc: [
		"If this machine is placed above a big enough source of &bwater&r, it will start &efishing&r automatically."
		""
		"Have in mind this one will consume a big amount of &benergy&r."
	]
	quest.262B4DF170A4A4AA.quest_subtitle: "Fishing rods are a thing of the past."
	quest.262B4DF170A4A4AA.title: "Automatic Fishing"
	quest.264992B0F6D2E6F4.quest_desc: [
		"The &eDragon Heart&r is dropped by the &dEnder Dragon&r."
		""
		"Respawn the Ender Dragon to get more Dragon Hearts."
	]
	quest.264992B0F6D2E6F4.title: "&dHeartbroken&r"
	quest.26773BD4D3A2CC70.quest_desc: ["The &dWeather Crystal&r is used to craft the &eInfinity Range Booster&r for your Refined Storage ME system."]
	quest.26773BD4D3A2CC70.quest_subtitle: "Shimmers strangely"
	quest.26C08AC85914C74B.quest_desc: [
		"&bHeat sources&r like &dMagma Blocks&r can boost your height, while &brain&r increases the risk of lightning damage! "
		""
		"Use &bupgrades&r to remove these drawbacks and improve your &egliding experience&r."
	]
	quest.26C08AC85914C74B.quest_subtitle: "Prevents burning from lightning strikes"
	quest.26C08AC85914C74B.title: "Resistant Glider I"
	quest.26F9145608F19529.quest_desc: ["&bEnergetic Alloy Ingots&r can be used as a material to create this&e giant torch&r that will block any hostile mob from spawning in a large area."]
	quest.26F9145608F19529.quest_subtitle: "goodbye danger"
	quest.272D0F09810DDC4C.quest_desc: [
		"Transporters are a great way to move items or fluids over short distances."
		""
		"Other mods may offer different alternatives, but it's always useful to know how to work with them just in case."
	]
	quest.272D0F09810DDC4C.quest_subtitle: "I need this somewhere else."
	quest.272D0F09810DDC4C.title: "Material management"
	quest.27AB5CE378BC18F3.quest_desc: [
		"This vial allows you to store or retrieve &aexperience&r from blocks that can hold it.  "
		""
		"It is especially useful for the &dSoul Binder&r, which requires both experience and forge energy to function."
	]
	quest.27B10C68B9463181.quest_desc: [
		"&dAdamant&r is a basic alloy used to create the &dAssembler&r, &dSteam Engine&r, machine cores, and various components and tools."
		""
		"The &dFoundry&r can produce more &eadamant&r with &bfewer diamonds&r and &bnickel&r."
	]
	quest.27B10C68B9463181.quest_subtitle: "Very hard but brittle, and it is partly see-through!"
	quest.282F720B59C10653.quest_desc: [
		"&dSoul Vial&r is used to capture and store the souls of living creatures."
		""
		"Right-click on a mob to trap it inside, then release it wherever needed."
	]
	quest.282F720B59C10653.quest_subtitle: "Does it work on the Warden?"
	quest.2924231931C7E34D.quest_desc: [
		"&dSkeleton Armor&r is a lightweight set that &benhances mobility&r and repels skeletons&e."
		""
		"It inflicts damage on any entity that makes contact."
	]
	quest.2924231931C7E34D.title: "Bone"
	quest.2992F30FF366B818.quest_desc: [
		"Once the &eCroissant Dragon&r hatches from its egg, you will need to feed it &bmilk buckets&r in order for it to grow and be &etamable&r!"
		""
		"Its attacks deal no damage, but can &aslow targets&r. You can also equip it with a flavored armor set to add a &apositive effect&r for you, or a &anegative effect&r for enemies!"
	]
	quest.2992F30FF366B818.quest_subtitle: "Support companion!"
	quest.2992F30FF366B818.title: "The Croissant Dragon"
	quest.2A6EC3DBA8453F49.quest_desc: [
		"In order to get started with this mod, you will require to craft a &eGreat Chalice&r from &bCopper Ingots&r."
		""
		"Once that's done, start gathering some&e essence&r from &bkilling mobs&r and fill it up!"
	]
	quest.2A6EC3DBA8453F49.quest_subtitle: "Please don't drink from this..."
	quest.2A6EC3DBA8453F49.title: "&bThe Great Chalice"
	quest.2AE068753481C7E4.quest_desc: [
		"&dSteampunk Armor&r combines intricate gears, brass, and advanced gadgets."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Its helmet includes a &ehostile radar system&r."
		""
		"The chest plate offers an &eenhanced GUI&r."
		""
		"The leggings allow &edouble jumping&r."
		""
		"The boots &enegate fall damage&r with integrated steam jets."
	]
	quest.2AE068753481C7E4.title: "Steampunk"
	quest.2BE1F1F364E8F15C.quest_desc: ["Once you get the basics, you can start looking at more &eadvanced alloys&r that will require you to obtain resources from the &bNether&r, or by killing &bendermen&r."]
	quest.2BE1F1F364E8F15C.quest_subtitle: "Better machines!"
	quest.2BE1F1F364E8F15C.title: "&dAdvanced Alloys"
	quest.2C083FCCFA11A680.quest_desc: [
		"Reliquary adds several &emagic staffs&r that can do very useful things, like shooting fireballs or placing torches at very long distances."
		""
		"Most of them will require you to &bconsume items&r in order to charge them up though."
	]
	quest.2C083FCCFA11A680.quest_subtitle: "Magic everywhere!"
	quest.2C083FCCFA11A680.title: "Staffs!"
	quest.2C4C988FCF67BDC1.quest_subtitle: "Required for Multiblock machines"
	quest.2D592B99E368F12C.quest_desc: [
		"Smelting &brubber&r in any furnace will result in &eplastic&r, which is a key component in this mod."
		""
		"Before advancing, make sure to get a good amount of it."
	]
	quest.2D592B99E368F12C.quest_subtitle: "No pollution involved (probably)"
	quest.2D592B99E368F12C.title: "Plastic"
	quest.2DB65B686F757B89.quest_subtitle: "&6Sleep is essential for life!&r"
	quest.2DB65B686F757B89.title: "First Base"
	quest.2E9B5E7158B6A077.quest_desc: [
		"It uses normal &bfurnace fuels&r and produces &e32 RF/t&r, enough to run your first processing machines."
		""
		"Once online, a &dPowered Furnace&r is a good first convenience upgrade."
	]
	quest.2F0255383ABBCD1A.title: "Shulker Box"
	quest.2F38367412C48CE5.quest_subtitle: "Destroy Ancient Vases at your own risk, as a deadly Stalker might emerge from the shattered remains!"
	quest.2F7202E7371A8609.quest_desc: [
		"By combining the powder of a Nether creature with Ender Pearls, we created a device that led us to a different kind of portal.  "
		"It was hidden deep beneath the ground, silently waiting for us.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6To avoid repeating past mistakes, we built a stronghold around it, determined to be better prepared before entering another unknown dimension.&r  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"When we stepped through, we found ourselves in a vast void, filled only with floating islands, towering obsidian pillars, and a massive dragon.  "
		"&cThe creature attacked without hesitation, and we fought back out of instinct.&r  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"After a brutal battle, we brought the dragon down.  "
		"Its death revealed smaller portals scattered across the islands, allowing us to teleport within the End itself.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"But something about this place remained unsettling.  "
		"&6We could feel it; something far greater than the defeated dragon lingered beyond the horizon.&r  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Our gear was not strong enough to reach it.  "
		"We returned to the Overworld, knowing we would one day come back prepared for whatever waited in the dark.  "
	]
	quest.2F7202E7371A8609.title: "Free the End"
	quest.2FAC4A5C97A1FC84.title: "Iron"
	quest.2FC0FEB60F57044A.quest_desc: ["The &dWired Charger&r is used to recharge tools and items that run on &aForge Energy&r (FE). Simply place the item inside, and it will restore its power over time."]
	quest.30754AD971FE81FA.quest_desc: [
		"&bEssence&r obtained from the &aMob Crusher&r can be used by an &aEnchantment Factory&r in order to &eenchant&r your items."
		""
		"If you don't like how your enchants turn out, you can always extract them into a &ebook&r by using the &aEnchantment Extractor&r, or directly convert them back into &eEssence&r."
		""
		"Finally, the &aEnchantment Applicator&r can be used to &eapply&r enchantments from a &bbook&r using &bEssence&r. It also works as an anvil."
	]
	quest.30754AD971FE81FA.quest_subtitle: "You are a wizard now!"
	quest.30754AD971FE81FA.title: "Efficient Enchantment"
	quest.31675182D60BE2F6.quest_desc: ["A &bConstructor&r places Blocks from your storage."]
	quest.3188C5E3B0022DB2.quest_desc: ["Reinforced Echo Shards are crafted using Warden Carapace, a rare drop from defeating the Warden."]
	quest.3188C5E3B0022DB2.quest_subtitle: "Tier above Netherite!"
	quest.3188C5E3B0022DB2.title: "&dWarden Tier&r"
	quest.31CBC97019DF958F.quest_desc: [
		"At the edge of the End, the Builders found something waiting."
		"A red dragon, greater than the Ender Dragon, older than any being we had encountered."
		""
		"&cIt struck without warning, its sheer presence warping the sky around it.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&cThe battle that followed was a disaster.&r"
		""
		"The creature’s fury sent shockwaves through dimensions, tearing through the very fabric of reality."
		""
		"&6The Overworld trembled, ravines split the land, and the world itself seemed on the verge of fracturing.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The Builders lost."
		"Their strongest weapons failed, their machines fell, and those who survived fled, never to return."
		""
		"&6In the aftermath, the ruins of their machines and the devastation across the dimensions left only one name for the creature that ended their era.&r"
		""
		"&cThe Chaos Guardian.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Yet the scars of that battle remain, and some believe the damage was only the beginning."
		""
		"&6If the Chaos Guardian is challenged again, the Overworld itself may not survive.&r"
		""
		"The next battle could tear the land apart completely, leaving only fragments drifting in the &dExosphere&r."
	]
	quest.31CBC97019DF958F.title: "Shattering Earth"
	quest.320B4924DE69D18B.quest_desc: ["The Autocrafting Upgrade automatically crafts missing items when transferring, preventing resource shortages."]
	quest.329C5E37748E57AC.quest_desc: [
		"The next step will be to send the obtained &blatex&r into the &aProcessing Unit&r in order to create &edry rubber&r."
		""
		"Unlike the previous one, this machine will not start working until an &benergy source&r is provided."
	]
	quest.329C5E37748E57AC.quest_subtitle: "You will need a lot of this."
	quest.329C5E37748E57AC.title: "Rubber"
	quest.3304595AB89E3F75.quest_desc: [
		"Long ago, the Overworld was untouched. It stretched endlessly, a world of forests, mountains, and oceans."
		" "
		"&6We were the first to shape it.  &r"
		"We carved rivers, raised walls, and built towers that touched the sky.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6We were the Builders, and the world was ours to mold.&r  "
		""
		"We built homes and settlements, filling them with knowledge, industry, and progress. "
		"We learned to farm the land, to tame animals, and to master the elements around us.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Over time, our cities rose, growing into vast civilizations.  "
		"&cOur hunger for discovery was endless.&r  "
		""
		"As our mastery of the world expanded, so did our curiosity.  "
		"The Overworld was vast, but it was not enough.  "
		"&6We wanted to know what lay beyond.&r"
	]
	quest.3304595AB89E3F75.title: "Thriving Civilization"
	quest.330A59FF8E2209E9.quest_desc: [
		"Oritech includes an &dOracle Index&r &eingame documentation&r."
		""
		"Hover your mouse over a supported Oritech item (e.g., a machine) and hold the &bALT&r key to open the ingame index."
	]
	quest.330A59FF8E2209E9.quest_subtitle: "Official ingame documentation"
	quest.331B544251B0E40B.quest_desc: [
		"When placed adjacent to a &bpipe extraction point&r and &bpowered with RF&r, it massively &eincreases the speed&r at which items and fluids are pulled."
		"{@pagebreak}"
